When I am logged into AIG and click on any report
Then the title of the report should be plan text without a link

When I click the ellipsis at the top right selecting "Create New Dashboard"
Then the title for the new report will say [Unpublished] before the name

When I click File then Save, then click the ellipsis selecting Publish
And I go back to the ellipsis selecting Create New Draft
Then the report title will start with a link to the original, followed by the unlinked name of the current report